Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.4 33/40] scsi: libsas: always unregister the old device if going to discover new
Date:   Sat,  9 Nov 2019 21:50:25 -0500
Message-Id: <20191110025032.827-33-sashal@kernel.org>
